;;; applyfn-chunk-pins.el --- applyfn defuns pinned to chunk 0  -*- lexical-binding: t; -*-
;; The F1 prelink closure (policy 384, scripts/nelisp-native-compiler-f1-prelink.py)
;; walks every direct call from its roots.  Split across chunks, the lost
;; intra-unit inlining made it 417 functions (> 384; unsplit <= 352).  These
;; applyfn defuns (the closure members found in the applyfn units of a K=8
;; build) stay together in chunk 0 so their calls remain intra-unit.  The proof
;; bound is NOT changed.  Regenerate from a closure listing if the F1 roots change.
